DTEND:20260928T231933Z
SUMMARY:(1) Ceres hides a mag 11.8 star
DESCRIPTION:(1) Ceres hides a magnitude 11.8 star\, seen from Darjeeling.\n
 You are inside the path\, 53 km from its centre line: the star vanishes fo
 r up to 42.8 s.\nClosest approach 04:44:33 IST\, give or take 1 s. The sta
 r is 69° up in the E · dusk.\nIt fades 0.1 magnitudes for up to 42.3 s o
 n the centre line\, and the path is 939 km wide\, give or take 19 km.\nFin
 der chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroid
 s-2026-09#2026-09-28-1-ceres-708160
